 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Pragmatic function of doch and ja in cultured conversation",
     "texto": [
      "Modal particles do not alter the syntax or the propositional truth value, but they reflect the speaker's communicative attitude:",
      "1. **ja**: signals that the information is considered known or evident to both interlocutors (**Das Bild ist ja weltberühmt**, \"the painting is, as you know, world-famous\"). It evokes complicity or prior consensus.",
      "2. **doch**: can recall a forgotten fact, formulate a measured warning or invite agreement in the face of a doubt (**Du kennst doch dieses Motiv**, \"but you know this motif, don't you?\"; **Schau doch mal genauer hin**, \"take a closer look\").",
      "They never occupy first position in the clause nor carry main stress except in replies of contradiction."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Modal particle",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "Main communicative effect",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "Example in dialogue",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      }
     ],
     "filas": [
      [
       {
        "texto": "ja",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Presupposes mutual knowledge («as you already know»)",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Wir wissen ja, wie selten echte Renaissance-Gemälde sind.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "doch",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Gentle objection or reactivation of a memory («but surely...»)",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Das Werk wurde doch erst kürzlich restauriert!",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "wohl",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Plausible conjecture without full certainty («probably»)",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Der Künstler war damals wohl in Italien tätig.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "denn",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Question with genuine interest or surprise («really...?»)",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Gibt es denn noch andere Skizzen dieser Epoche?",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       }
      ]
     ],
     "nota": "",
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
